      "question": {
        ":question/id": "f33fad89-1bf5-5863-a27a-cf99ad3f26e6",
        ":question/problem": "Using the fact that\n\n$$\n-\\frac{11\\pi}{12}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}-\\frac{7\\pi}{6},\n$$\n\ncalculate the **exact** value of $\\cos\\left(-\\frac{11\\pi}{12}\\right)$.\n\n$\\cos\\left(-\\frac{11\\pi}{12}\\right)=$ {{field-1}}",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Recall the difference formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cos(x-y)=\\cos x\\cos y+\\sin x\\sin y.\n$$\n\nApply it to the decomposition:\n\n$$\n\\cos\\left(-\\frac{11\\pi}{12}\\right)=\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}-\\frac{7\\pi}{6}\\right).\n$$\n\n$$\n\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\\cos\\left(\\frac{7\\pi}{6}\\right)+\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\\sin\\left(\\frac{7\\pi}{6}\\right)\n$$\n\nSubstitute the signed special-angle values and combine:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot \\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot \\left(- \\frac{1}{2}\\right) \\\\\n&=\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{4}\\right)+\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}\\right) \\\\\n&=- \\frac{\\sqrt{2} + \\sqrt{6}}{4}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
        ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
